            </div>

            <div id="p-detection-banner" class="auto-detect-badge" style="background: #1c252e; border-color: #007bff;">
                <span>⚙️ ENGINE TELEMETRY STATUS:</span>
                <span id="p-detected-type-label" style="font-family: monospace; font-weight: bold;">STANDBY — READ REQS DETECTED FROM SIMBRIEF DISPATCH</span>
            </div>

            <div id="p-weight-manifest-bar" style="margin-bottom: 15px; padding: 15px; background: #181818; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #333; display: none; flex-direction: row; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
                <div style="flex: 1; min-width: 150px;">
                    <span style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--text-muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Zero Fuel Weight (ZFW)</span>
